<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Appendix A Experimental Details in Section ‣ Beyond Sequential Reranking: Reranker-Guided Search Improves Reasoning Intensive Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompt for Gemini-2.0-Flash</span></a></li>
